# Dawnhand Dissident: "During your turn, you may cast creature spells from among cards you own exiled with this creature by removing
# three counters from among creatures you control ..." - "you" is the Dissident's controller (CR 109.5), and the cards must be theirs
# (CR 108.3). Bot1 bolts Bot2's Llanowar Elves and exiles them from Bot2's graveyard with the Dissident, blighting 2 onto its Sylvan
# Caryatid: with three counters among its creatures and {G} open, Bot1 can't cast the Elves, which Bot2 owns. On its own turn Bot2
# gains control of the Dissident with Vengeful Possession (untapped, with haste), blights the Dissident itself to surveil, and casts
# its own Elves from exile by removing three counters from among the creatures it now controls: the Dissident's -1/-1 counter and
# its Walking Ballista's two +1/+1 counters (CR 118.3). Bot1's counters are not touched.

